\subsection{Residual-IA: Closing the Remaining Gap}
\label{app:gate_pathology}

This subsection develops the architectural fix that closes the residual DLinear gap left by RR-MoA. The core idea is to extend the raw-input principle from the \emph{router} (RR-MoA's contribution) to each \emph{expert}: every expert is a dual-stream module with a shared NLinear raw branch and a gated backbone-residual branch, so the linear baseline survives even when the TSFM features are uninformative. Figure~\ref{fig:residual_ia_arch} shows the architecture; subsequent tables sweep gate-pathology diagnostics, multi-horizon, and cross-backbone behavior.

